    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA luxurious and exceptionally spacious three-bedroom first-floor apartment offering a rare double-aspect layout, excellent natural light and a large sunroom/balcony with panoramic views.\n\nNo. 39 The Croft is an impressive three-bedroom apartment situated within this highly sought-after development in Loughlinstown. Finished to a very high standard and presented in excellent condition throughout, this stylish home offers a superb combination of space, light and comfort.\n\nThe generously proportioned accommodation is ideally suited to modern family living, professionals seeking additional space or those looking for an upscale downsizing opportunity in a well-connected location.\n\nDesigned for Light and Modern Living\nA rare double-aspect layout allows natural light to flow through the apartment throughout the day, enhancing its bright and inviting atmosphere.\nThe open-plan living area provides a spacious and comfortable setting for everyday life and entertaining. It is complemented by a superb sunroom/balcony, which is one of the property's most distinctive features. Generous in size and highly versatile, this wonderful space is ideal for enjoying a morning coffee, relaxing or entertaining while taking in the panoramic outlook.\n\nEach of the three well-appointed bedrooms offers comfortable proportions and a peaceful retreat from the main living accommodation. The overall layout has been thoughtfully designed to provide an excellent balance between open-plan living and private space.\n\nAn Excellent Location\nThe Croft enjoys a convenient setting in Loughlinstown, offering a peaceful residential atmosphere while remaining close to a wide variety of amenities. Shops, schools, parks and recreational facilities are all within easy reach, while the coastline and nearby walking routes provide further opportunities to enjoy the outdoors.\n\nThe surrounding areas of Cabinteely, Killiney, Shankill and Dún Laoghaire offer an extensive selection of shopping, dining, leisure and coastal amenities.\nSuperb Transport Connections\nThe development is exceptionally well placed for commuters and those travelling throughout Dublin and beyond.\n\n• Regular bus services provide convenient access to the city centre and surrounding areas.\n• The nearby LUAS offers a reliable connection to Dublin City.\n• The N11 and M50 are easily accessible.\n• The location provides convenient links to South Dublin, the city centre and the wider national road network.\n\nSpecial Features\n• Luxurious three-bedroom first-floor apartment\n• Exceptionally spacious and well-proportioned accommodation\n• Presented in excellent condition throughout\n• Finished to a very high standard\n• Rare double-aspect layout\n• Excellent natural light throughout\n• Generous open-plan living accommodation\n• Large and versatile sunroom/balcony\n• Panoramic views\n• Three well-appointed bedrooms\n• Ideal family home or upscale downsizing opportunity\n• Peaceful and highly sought-after development\n• Convenient to shops, schools, parks and coastal walks\n• Excellent bus and LUAS connections\n• Easy access to the N11 and M50\n• Annual management fee of approximately 3,100\n\nNo. 39 The Croft is a beautifully presented and light-filled apartment combining generous accommodation, a versatile sunroom/balcony and superb connectivity in a highly convenient South Dublin location."
      },
